<title>SPAIN: Spain Sept M4 rose provisional 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Sept M4 rose provisional 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   AUG 96	JULY 96	AUG 95</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     9.3	   2.6	   14.1</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise   12.6	   3.0	    3.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
</text>
